#: kcm.cpp:78
msgid ""
"Unable to save settings because a temporary directory could not be created."
msgstr ""
"Ne mogu da sačuvam postavke jer ne mogu da napravim privremenu fasciklu."

#: kcm.cpp:139
msgid "Unable to save settings because the config could not be opened."
msgstr "Ne mogu da sačuvam postavke jer ne mogu da otvorim postavu."

#: kcm.cpp:214
msgid ""
"Unable to synchronise Plasma settings because the 'plasmalogin' user does "
"not exist. Please check your Plasma Login install."
msgstr ""
"Ne mogu da sinhronizujem postavke Plasme jer korisnik „plasmalogin“ ne "
"postoji. Provjerite instalaciju menadžera prijavljivanja Plasme."

#: kcm.cpp:269
msgid ""
"Unable to reset Plasma settings because the 'plasmalogin' user does not "
"exist. Please check your Plasma Login install."
msgstr ""
"Ne mogu da resetujem postavke Plasme jer korisnik „plasmalogin“ ne postoji. "
"Provjerite instalaciju menadžera prijavljivanja Plasme."

